omes from the console of place 1. Battery alarm: warns below this voltage (0 = off).</p><p style='color:#aaa'>Consoles sending now: ␀<h3>Konzolok Ã©s helyisÃ©gek</h3><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>A konzol azonosÃ­tÃ³ja egy rÃ©szlet a konzol Ã¡ltal kÃ¼ldÃ¶tt <i>model</i> vagy <i>stationtype</i> mezÅ‘bÅ‘l (pl. WS3910). Ãœresen hagyva a hely nincs hasznÃ¡latban. Az 1. hely konzoljÃ¡tÃ³l jÃ¶n a kinti (WS90) adat is. AkkuriasztÃ¡s: e feszÃ¼ltsÃ©g alatt figyelmeztet (0 = nincs).</p><p style='color:#aaa'>Most kÃ¼ldÅ‘ konzolok: ␀␀ (not assigned)␀ (nincs hozzÃ¡rendelve)␀egyik sem␀␀␀<h4 style='margin:14px 0 0'>Place %d%s</h4><label>Name</label><input name='r%dn' maxlength='15' value='%s'><label>Console identifier</label><input name='r%dm' maxlength='20' value='%s'><label>Battery alarm (V)</label><input name='r%dv' type='number' step='0.1' min='0' max='10' value='%.1f'>␀<h4 style='margin:14px 0 0'>%d. hely%s</h4><label>NÃ©v</label><input name='r%dn' maxlength='15' value='%s'><label>Konzol azonosÃ­tÃ³ja</label><input name='r%dm' maxlength='20' value='%s'><label>AkkuriasztÃ¡s (V)</label><input name='r%dv' type='number' step='0.1' min='0' max='10' value='%.1f'>␀␀␀ (outdoor data also comes from here)␀␀␀␀ (innen jÃ¶n a kinti adat is)␀␀␀<option value='0'>Magyar</option><option value='1' selected>English</option>␀␀␀␀<option value='0' selected>Magyar</option><option value='1'>English</option>␀␀␀␀<h3>Night mode</h3>␀<h3>Ã‰jszakai mÃ³d</h3>␀ style='width:auto;margin:0 8px 0 0'>On</label><label>Schedule</label><select name='n_mode' style='font-size:18px;width:100%%;margin:14px 0'><option value='0'%s>By clock (the times below)</option><option value='1'%s>By sunset (needs the location)</option></select>␀␀␀␀ style='width:auto;margin:0 8px 0 0'>Bekapcsolva</label><label>IdÅ‘zÃ­tÃ©s</label><select name='n_mode' style='font-size:18px;width:100%%;margin:14px 0'><option value='0'%s>Ã“ra szerint (a lenti idÅ‘pontok)</option><option value='1'%s>Napnyugta szerint (hely kell hozzÃ¡)</option></select>␀␀␀<label>By clock: start</label><input type='time' name='n_st' value='%02d:%02d'><label>By clock: end</label><input type='time' name='n_en' value='%02d:%02d'>␀␀␀␀<label>Ã“ra szerint: kezdete</label><input type='time' name='n_st' value='%02d:%02d'><label>Ã“ra szerint: vÃ©ge</label><input type='time' name='n_en' value='%02d:%02d'>␀␀␀␀<label>By sunset: start, minutes after sunset (-120..180)</label><input type='number' name='n_so' min='-120' max='180' step='5' value='%d'><label>By sunset: end, minutes after sunrise (-120..180)</label><input type='number' name='n_ro' min='-120' max='180' step='5' value='%d'>␀␀␀<label>Napnyugta szerint: kezdete a napnyugta utÃ¡n (perc, -120..180)</label><input type='number' name='n_so' min='-120' max='180' step='5' value='%d'><label>Napnyugta szerint: vÃ©ge a napkelte utÃ¡n (perc, -120..180)</label><input type='number' name='n_ro' min='-120' max='180' step='5' value='%d'>␀<label>Night brightness (%%, 1-100)</label><input type='number' name='n_pct' min='1' max='100' value='%d'><label>Day brightness (%%, 10-100)</label><input type='number' name='d_pct' min='10' max='100' value='%d'>␀␀␀␀<label>Ã‰jszakai fÃ©nyerÅ‘ (%%, 1-100)</label><input type='number' name='n_pct' min='1' max='100' value='%d'><label>Nappali fÃ©nyerÅ‘ (%%, 10-100)</label><input type='number' name='d_pct' min='10' max='100' value='%d'>␀␀<p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Also adjustable on the display (times in 15-minute steps): tap the clock on the main page.</p>␀␀␀<p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>A kijelzÅ‘n is Ã¡llÃ­thatÃ³ (az idÅ‘pontok 15 perces lÃ©pÃ©sekben): a fÅ‘oldalon az Ã³rÃ¡ra koppintva.</p>␀␀␀Automatic brightness with the camera</label><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>The display follows the room's light, between the night (dark) and day (bright) brightness; if nobody moves in front of it for 10 minutes, it dims to the night brightness and wakes up on movement or touch. When on, it replaces the night mode schedule. The camera image never leaves the display and is not