megszÃ³lal; mentÃ©s a lenti gombbal)</label>␀' selected>␀MeghallgatÃ¡s␀␀␀<p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Silent during the night mode period (by clock or by sunset, see above), even if dimming is off. Also adjustable on the display: Settings / System.</p>␀␀␀<p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Az Ã©jszakai mÃ³d idÅ‘szakÃ¡ban (Ã³ra vagy napnyugta szerint, lÃ¡sd fent) nem szÃ³l, akkor sem, ha a sÃ¶tÃ©tÃ­tÃ©s ki van kapcsolva. A kijelzÅ‘n is Ã¡llÃ­thatÃ³: BeÃ¡llÃ­tÃ¡sok / Rendszer.</p>␀<h3>Forwarding to another display</h3><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>This display forwards the data received from the consoles unchanged to the <i>/ecowitt</i> address of the given display (e.g. idojaras-p4.local or 192.168.1.50). If the target is not reachable, this display keeps working normally. Phone notifications need to be set up on one display only.</p>␀␀<h3>TovÃ¡bbkÃ¼ldÃ©s mÃ¡sik kijelzÅ‘re</h3><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>A konzoloktÃ³l kapott adatokat ez a kijelzÅ‘ vÃ¡ltozatlanul tovÃ¡bbkÃ¼ldi a megadott kijelzÅ‘ <i>/ecowitt</i> cÃ­mÃ©re (pl. idojaras-p4.local vagy 192.168.1.50). Ha a cÃ©l nem Ã©rhetÅ‘ el, ennek a kijelzÅ‘nek a mÅ±kÃ¶dÃ©se nem vÃ¡ltozik. Telefonos Ã©rtesÃ­tÃ©st elÃ©g az egyiken beÃ¡llÃ­tani.</p>␀␀␀Forwarding on</label><label>Target (host name or IP)</label>␀␀␀␀TovÃ¡bbkÃ¼ldÃ©s bekapcsolva</label><label>CÃ©l (gÃ©pnÃ©v vagy IP)</label>␀␀␀'><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Last forward: ␀'><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>UtolsÃ³ tovÃ¡bbkÃ¼ldÃ©s: ␀␀%s (successful: %u, failed: %u, dropped: %u)␀␀␀␀%s (sikeres: %u, hibÃ¡s: %u, elmaradt: %u)␀␀no target set␀␀␀nincs megadva cÃ©l␀␀off␀kikapcsolva␀<h3>Password</h3>␀␀␀<h3>JelszÃ³</h3>␀␀␀␀Change password</label><input type='password' name='newpw' id='newpw' maxlength='32' autocomplete='new-password' disabled placeholder='new password (empty: no password)'><input type='password' name='newpw2' id='newpw2' maxlength='32' autocomplete='new-password' disabled placeholder='new password again'><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Password now: ␀␀␀JelszÃ³ mÃ³dosÃ­tÃ¡sa</label><input type='password' name='newpw' id='newpw' maxlength='32' autocomplete='new-password' disabled placeholder='Ãºj jelszÃ³ (Ã¼resen hagyva: nincs jelszÃ³)'><input type='password' name='newpw2' id='newpw2' maxlength='32' autocomplete='new-password' disabled placeholder='Ãºj jelszÃ³ mÃ©g egyszer'><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>JelszÃ³ most: ␀set (user name: admin)␀␀be van Ã¡llÃ­tva (felhasznÃ¡lÃ³nÃ©v: admin)␀nincs␀␀␀Save settings</button><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Saves the location, time zone, rooms, night mode, notifications, forwarding and (if ticked) the password at once.</p></form><form method='POST' action='/ntfytest'><button type='submit' style='background:#444;color:#eee'>Send a test message to the phone</button></form><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>The test message goes to the topic already saved.</p><p style='color:#aaa'>The location is needed for sunrise/sunset and the forecast. The IP lookup queries ipwho.is from your browser (fallback: ip-api.com); it is only accurate to a city (often the provider's location), check it before saving.</p>␀␀BeÃ¡llÃ­tÃ¡sok mentÃ©se</button><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Egyszerre menti a helyet, az idÅ‘zÃ³nÃ¡t, a helyisÃ©geket, az Ã©jszakai mÃ³dot, az Ã©rtesÃ­tÃ©seket, a tovÃ¡bbkÃ¼ldÃ©st Ã©s (ha bepipÃ¡ltad) a jelszÃ³t.</p></form><form method='POST' action='/ntfytest'><button type='submit' style='background:#444;color:#eee'>PrÃ³baÃ¼zenet kÃ¼ldÃ©se a telefonra</button></form><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>A prÃ³baÃ¼zenet a mÃ¡r elmentett tÃ©mÃ¡ra megy.</p><p style='color:#aaa'>A hely a napkelte/napnyugtÃ¡hoz Ã©s az elÅ‘rejelzÃ©shez kell. Az IP alapÃº keresÃ©s a bÃ¶ngÃ©szÅ‘dbÅ‘l kÃ©rdezi le az ipwho.is-t (tartalÃ©k: ip-api.com); ez csak vÃ¡rosnyi pontossÃ¡gÃº (gyakran a szolgÃ¡ltatÃ³ kÃ¶zpontja), mentÃ©s elÅ‘tt ellenÅ‘rizd.</p>␀var L=['The two passwords do not match.','Searching...','Found: ',' - check it before saving!','Failed: none of the location services is reachable.'];␀␀var L=['A kÃ©t 